 | SCENARIO-VERIFY-5325 | Typed Rewrite Transitions Accept Safe Rewrites And Reject Unsafe Ones | Implemented | Artifact follows the deterministic rewrite-state fixture path across six case types: safe_paraphrase, contradiction_introduction, missing_required_change, fabricated_premise_citation, invalid_premise_preserved, and overbroad_rewrite. It records the safe paraphrase accepted, five unsafe or invalid rewrites rejected, complete_change_coverage_rate=1.0, rewrite_acceptability_rate=1.0, unsafe_rewrite_rejection_rate=1.0, false_accept_count=0, and consumer_contract.next_experiment=Exp5326. No retro closure, AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement, violation_rate, live LLM quality, or hardware speedup claim is recorded. |
