+| SCENARIO-VERIFY-5326 | Stable Exp5324 Runtime Produces Fixture-Scored Smoke | Implemented-Partial | Artifact follows the stable Exp5324 `flagship_dense` `llama-cli` backend path with selected model `unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF`, GPU visibility, fixture availability, and three bounded generation receipts. The outputs were fixture-scored but did not parse into the expected compact JSON, so paraphrase_label_preservation_rate=0.0 and rewrite_acceptability_rate=0.0; unsafe_false_accepts=0 and headline_quality_claim=false. The scenario is partial/research-finding evidence only: no retro closure, AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement, violation_rate, broad SOTA quality, or hardware speedup claim is recorded. |
